ffe
------------------------------------------
Flat file extractor (ffe) can be used for parsing different flat file
structures and printing them in different formats. ffe can also process fixed
length binary files.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcrypt20-1.12.4-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libgcrypt-devel-1.12.4-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/igitur/ffe

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/igitur/ffe/archive/refs/tags/v0.4.1d.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack ffe-0.4.1d-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./ffe-0.4.1d-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/ffe-0.4.1d-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/ffe-0.4.1d-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(ffe)
  /usr/bin/ffe.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/ffe.README
  /usr/share/doc/ffe/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/ffe/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/ffe/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/ffe/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/ffe/README
  /usr/share/doc/ffe/ffe.html
  /usr/share/info/ffe.info.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/ffe.1.gz

